are grid: $\overrightarrow{OA}=\mathbf{a}$, $\overrightarrow{OB}=\mathbf{b}$, and $\overrightarrow{OC}=\mathbf{c}$.

![Vector diagram](images/28/28da4f28a9c39d920981931bc1f5244ed8c7b3ee95a4f03b4117cf9571df87a3.png)

Given that $\mathbf{c}=\lambda\mathbf{a}+\mu\mathbf{b}$, find $\lambda$ and $\mu$.

$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/ba/ba64fc7f92d4394d5830087812d4046c85ee2a171d65d4686f6b2cdf85aee8b4.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{b}$.

Along $OX$, move $1$ square right. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square right. Thus $OX=1|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=\mathbf{a}$.

Along $XC$, move $4$ squares left and $4$ squares down. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=2|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\mathbf{b}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=\mathbf{a}-2\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=1$ and $\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/answer-fields "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d"] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/answer-fields "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff"] [:db/ensure "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f"] [:db/add "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/id #uuid "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232"] [:db/add "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/validate] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/id #uuid "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364"] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/choices "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232"] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/correct "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232"] [:db/ensure "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/id #uuid "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9"] [:db/add "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/id #uuid "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae"] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298