$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/98/987deafa84eb84d12dfa785cf4df946b641f8a06a08be1ca4a3392ed04732900.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{b}$.

Along $OX$, move $4$ squares right. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares left. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\mathbf{a}$.

Along $XC$, move $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square left and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=2|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\mathbf{b}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=-2\mathbf{a}-2\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=-2$ and $\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/answer-fields "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364"] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/answer-fields "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae"] [:db/ensure "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2"] [:db/add "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/id #uuid "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e"] [:db/add "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/value "-3"] [:db/ensure "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/id #uuid "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7"] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/choices "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e"] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/correct "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e"] [:db/ensure "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/id #uuid "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521"] [:db/add "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/id #uuid "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903"] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/choices "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521"] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/correct "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521"] [:db/ensure "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/id #uuid "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c"] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\overrightarrow{OA}=\mathbf{a}$, $\overrightarrow{OB}=\mathbf{b}$, and $\overrightarrow{OC}=\mathbf{c}$.

