Given that $\mathbf{c}=\lambda\mathbf{a}+\mu\mathbf{b}$, find $\lambda$ and $\mu$.

$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/aa/aae1ea60df4eb3030354dc404cd0fc0670d46d46fa7ffe192129a30d5e59c77d.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{b}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{a}$.

Along $OX$, move $4$ squares left and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square down. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\mathbf{b}$.

Along $XC$, move $6$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares down. Thus $XC=3|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=-3\mathbf{a}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=-2\mathbf{b}-3\mathbf{a}\\&=-3\mathbf{a}-2\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Reorder the terms to match their vector names. Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=-3$ and $\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/answer-fields "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7"] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/answer-fields "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903"] [:db/ensure "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c"] [:db/add "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/id #uuid "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b"] [:db/add "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/value "-\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/id #uuid "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4"] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/choices "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b"] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/correct "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b"] [:db/ensure "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/id #uuid "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd"] [:db/add "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/id #uuid "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-