$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=-2\mathbf{b}+\frac{1}{2}\mathbf{a}\\&=\frac{1}{2}\mathbf{a}-2\mathbf{b}
